WHERE THE LICENSE TEXT IS INSIDE THE IMAGE

Every image carries the text. After pulling:

  Erebine agent binaries (MIT)  /usr/share/licenses/erebine/LICENSE
  Swift packages in them        /usr/share/licenses/erebine/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES
  NVIDIA, on the CUDA images    /workspace/license.txt and
                                /opt/nvidia/entrypoint.d/
  AMD, on the ROCm image        /opt/rocm/share/doc/<component>/
  Base distribution packages    /usr/share/doc/<package>/copyright
  Python packages               <dist>.dist-info/ in the image's venv

Read a file inside an image without starting an agent:

``` shell
podman run --rm --entrypoint /bin/cat \
  ghcr.io/erebine/container-agents/eim-vllm-cuda:latest \
  /workspace/license.txt
```

